      "npc" : "Site manager Elmen",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@val"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "{0} Dynite have been refined. It's perfect today!",
      "translation" : "已经精炼了{0}个达因石。今天的状态真不错！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Site manager Elmen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elmen]",
      "translation" : "[埃尔门]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Site manager Elmen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There are various accessories and modification permits. Look carefully at what you want before buying.",
      "translation" : "这里有各种饰品和改造许可证。购买前请仔细看看你想要什么。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Site manager Elmen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elmen]",
      "translation" : "[埃尔门]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Site manager Elmen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I can exchange the equipment with the Dynite, but it's already in a tightly sealed box.",
      "translation" : "我可以用达因石兑换装备，不过装备已经装在密封箱里了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Site manager Elmen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Give me 50 ^4d4dffDynites^000000 and I will open a ^4d4dffweapon box^000000 for you.",
      "translation" : "给我50个^4d4dff达因石^000000，我就为你打开一个^4d4dff武器箱^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Site manager Elmen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elmen]",
      "translation" : "[埃尔门]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "npc" : "Site manager Elmen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I don't know what will come out, but the quality is good. Would you like to open it?",
      "translation" : "我也不知道里面会开出什么，不过品质不错。要打开吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Site manager Elmen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Close your eyes and exchange.",
      "translation" : "闭上眼睛进行兑换。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Site manager Elmen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Do not exchange.",
      "translation" : "不兑换。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Site manager Elmen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elmen]",
      "translation" : "[埃尔门]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Site manager Elmen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Kee, this is a waste, it was a good deal.",
      "translation" : "唉，真可惜，这可是笔好交易。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Site manager Elmen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elmen]",
      "translation" : "[埃尔门]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Site manager Elmen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You don't have enough Dynite friends.",
      "translation" : "你的达因石不够，朋友。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Site manager Elmen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I don't know what's going to come out, so it's hard to go anywhere and get this kind of equipment at this price.",
      "translation" : "我也不知道会开出什么；以这个价格，很难在别处买到这种装备。"
